#
# tools/mali/testdata: rows narrower than the catch-all row after them (first
# match wins); each matches only files the catch-all matched before.
#
# gm2_* cases whose GLSL is glmark2's own text, verbatim or with identifiers
# renamed and statements dropped: compared statement by statement, after
# identifier renaming, with glmark2 22c527cb data/shaders and the program text
# its src/scene-*.cpp assembles. glmark2 is GPL-3.0-or-later (its source
# headers; COPYING); offered here as GPL-3.0-only, as
# tools/hostharness/glmark2/host_main.cpp is, until
# LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt exists. NOTICE has no entry for them yet
# (plan #391). Their .expect.json (Mesa output only) carry no glmark2 text.
tools/mali/testdata/gm2_ideas_[123].frag | Apache-2.0 AND GPL-3.0-only | glmark2 22c527cb ideas-logo-shadow.frag, ideas-logo.frag, ideas-lamp-lit.frag with identifiers renamed
